<title>GERMANY: Buba sets Bubill tender for April 15.</title>
<headline>Buba sets Bubill tender for April 15.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank on Tuesday said it will hold a tender for about nine billion marks of six-month &quot;bubills&quot; on April 15.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on April 16 with bids for the issue due by 0900 GMT on that day.</p>
<p>The issue will settle on April 18 and will mature on October 17, 1997, the Bundesbank said.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
